#: sajha/web/templates/landing.html:110
msgid ""
"Eight SAJHA servers on a ring. They find each other, call each other's tools for one question, "
"fall back when a server goes down, quarantine a tool whose contract differs, and reach MCP "
"servers that two of them proxy: internal ones keep their tool names, external ones are never "
"members and their tools are offered as vendor__tool."
